Overlay patch 0034: SoH menu inside stereoscopic 3D (Gui split).
The 3D path skips gui StartDraw/EndDraw entirely (the Metal backend's ImGui
NewFrame acquires the SCREEN drawable — a stall while the window is hidden),
so the enhancement menu was unreachable in 3D. Split the frame: a public
build-once method that runs the ImGui frame WITHOUT the backend NewFrame
(the caller primes ImGui_ImplMetal against an eye framebuffer instead) and
skips DrawGame/viewport work (the menu composites OVER the already-rendered
eye images); the caller renders the resulting draw data into BOTH eyes
(ImGui explicitly supports rendering one draw list multiple times), then a
finish method closes the ImGui frame.

